<html lang="en">

<head>
  <title>Documentation — The Agent Kit | Jay Framework</title>
  <meta name="description"
    content="The Jay Stack Agent Kit — documentation written for AI agents, readable by humans. Role-specific guides for Designer, Developer, Plugin Developer, and DevOps.">
  <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-headless" src="../../components/site-header/site-header"
    contract="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-contract"
    template="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-html"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-headless" src="../../components/site-footer/site-footer"
    contract="../../components/site-footer/site-footer.jay-contract"
    template="../../components/site-footer/site-footer.jay-html"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles/theme.css">
  <style>
    body {
      background: var(--color-bg);
      color: var(--color-text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    .docs-hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 96px 0;
      /* design-system: allow */
      padding-top: 160px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .docs-hero-grid {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
      opacity: 0.3;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .docs-hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .docs-hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .docs-hero-headline {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .docs-hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 28px;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 32px auto 0;
    }

    /* ── Intro ── */
    .docs-intro {
      background: var(--color-surface);
    }

    .docs-intro-content {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .docs-intro-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .docs-intro-content p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* ── What's in the Kit ── */
    .docs-kit {
      background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
    }

    .docs-kit-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 48px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .docs-kit-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    .docs-kit-card {
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .docs-kit-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .docs-kit-card code {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--color-surface-high);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);
      padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
      /* design-system: allow */
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8em;
      /* design-system: allow */
    }

    .docs-kit-card p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── How Agents Use It ── */
    .docs-workflow {
      background: var(--color-surface);
    }

    .docs-workflow-steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 48px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .docs-workflow-steps {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      }
    }

    .docs-workflow-step {
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .docs-workflow-number {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.15);
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .docs-workflow-step h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .docs-workflow-step p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 22px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      margin: 0;
    }

    .docs-workflow-step code {
      background: var(--color-surface-high);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant);
      padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
      /* design-system: allow */
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85em;
      /* design-system: allow */
    }

    /* ── Role Cards ── */
    .docs-roles {
      background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
    }

    .docs-roles-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .docs-roles-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    .docs-extensibility {
      margin-top: 48px;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
      background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.03);
    }

    .docs-extensibility p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .docs-extensibility strong {
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .glass-panel {
      background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .glass-panel:hover {
      border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .docs-role-card {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    .docs-role-card:hover {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .docs-role-card--designer {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(176, 122, 237, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(176, 122, 237, 0.15);
    }

    .docs-role-card--developer {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(106, 191, 75, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(106, 191, 75, 0.15);
    }

    .docs-role-card--plugin {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 149, 46, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(212, 149, 46, 0.15);
    }

    .docs-role-card--devops {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(91, 140, 201, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(91, 140, 201, 0.15);
    }

    .docs-role-card--contracts {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.2), 0 0 4px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .docs-role-card--contracts {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .docs-role-icon {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      object-fit: contain;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .docs-role-body h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .docs-role-body p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .docs-role-body .docs-role-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    /* ── Hero Quick Links ── */
    .docs-hero-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    .docs-hero-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.15);
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }

    .docs-hero-link:hover {
      border-color: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.35);
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .docs-hero-link img {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 96px 0;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 16px;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ── Shimmer Pass ── */
    @keyframes shimmer-pass {
      0% {
        background-position: -150% center;
      }

      15% {
        background-position: -150% center;
      }

      35% {
        background-position: 150% center;
      }

      100% {
        background-position: 150% center;
      }
    }

    .shimmer-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .shimmer-base {
      color: inherit;
    }

    .shimmer-shine {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) 46%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) 54%, transparent 65%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      text-shadow: none;
      animation: shimmer-pass 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @scope (.siteHeader) {

      /* ── Header ── */
      .site-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(14, 19, 34, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
      }

      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 16px var(--margin-mobile);
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-inner {
          padding: 16px var(--margin-desktop);
        }
      }

      @keyframes brand-shimmer {
        0% {
          background-position: -200% center;
        }

        100% {
          background-position: 400% center;
        }
      }

      .header-brand {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .brand-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .brand-text-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .header-brand .brand-base {
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      .header-brand .brand-shine {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 45%, rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.9) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 55%, transparent 60%);
        background-size: 300% auto;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        animation: brand-shimmer 5s linear infinite;
      }

      .header-nav {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 32px;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-nav {
          display: flex;
        }
      }

      .header-nav a {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .header-nav a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .header-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .btn-get-started {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 8px 24px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .btn-get-started:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* Hide Get Started + GitHub on mobile, show hamburger */
      .header-actions .btn-get-started {
        display: none;
      }

      .header-actions .header-github {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      /* Hamburger button */
      .hamburger-toggle {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: none;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 0;
      }

      .hamburger-icon {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        width: 18px;
      }

      .hamburger-icon span {
        display: block;
        height: 2px;
        background: currentColor;
        border-radius: 1px;
        /* design-system: allow */
        transition: transform 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;
      }

      /* Mobile menu */
      #mobile-menu-toggle {
        display: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        z-index: 49;
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest, #0a0f1e);
        padding: 80px var(--margin-mobile) 32px;
        /* design-system: allow */
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(6px) rotate(45deg);
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(2) {
        opacity: 0;
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(3) {
        transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg);
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.mobile-menu {
        display: flex;
      }

      .mobile-menu a {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .mobile-menu a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-github {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-github svg {
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-actions .btn-get-started {
          display: inline-flex;
        }

        .header-actions .header-github {
          display: flex;
        }

        .hamburger-toggle {
          display: none;
        }

        .mobile-menu {
          display: none !important;
        }
      }
    }

    @scope (.siteFooter) {

      /* ── Footer ── */
      .site-footer {
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        padding: 48px 0;
      }

      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }

      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 2fr;
        }
      }

      .footer-brand {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .footer-copyright {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
      }

      .footer-heading {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .footer-links {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transition: color 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .footer-links a:hover {
        color: var(--color-secondary-dim);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page-root"><jay:site-header ref="siteHeader">
      <div class="site-header-root"><input type="checkbox" id="mobile-menu-toggle">
        <header class="site-header">
          <nav class="header-inner"><a href="/" class="header-brand" aria-label="Jay Framework"><img
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg"
                alt="" class="brand-icon" width="32" height="32" loading="eager"><span
                class="brand-text-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="brand-base">Jay
                  Framework</span><span class="brand-shine" aria-hidden="true">Jay
                  Framework</span></span></a>
            <div class="header-nav"><a href="/aiditor-intro">AIditor</a><a
                href="/ecosystem">Ecosystem</a><a href="/docs">Documentation</a><a
                href="/design-log">Design Log</a></div>
            <div class="header-actions"><a class="header-github"
                href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank"
                aria-label="GitHub"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <g fill="currentColor">
                    <path
                      d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                    </path>
                  </g>
                </svg></a><a class="btn-get-started" href="/get-started">Get Started</a><label
                for="mobile-menu-toggle" class="hamburger-toggle" aria-label="Menu">
                <div class="hamburger-icon"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </label></div>
          </nav>
        </header>
        <div class="mobile-menu"><a href="/aiditor-intro"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">AIditor</a><a
            href="/ecosystem"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">Ecosystem</a><a
            href="/docs"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">Documentation</a><a
            href="/design-log">Design Log</a>
          <div class="mobile-menu-actions"><a class="mobile-menu-github"
              href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank"><svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <g fill="currentColor">
                  <path
                    d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                  </path>
                </g>
              </svg> GitHub</a><a class="btn-get-started" href="/get-started"
              onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false"
              style="text-align: center; justify-content: center;">Get Started</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </jay:site-header>
    <main>
      <section class="docs-hero">
        <div class="docs-hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="docs-hero-content"><span class="docs-hero-badge">DOCUMENTATION</span>
            <h1 class="docs-hero-headline"><span class="shimmer-wrap"><span class="shimmer-base">The
                  Agent Kit</span><span class="shimmer-shine" aria-hidden="true">The Agent
                  Kit</span></span></h1>
            <p class="docs-hero-subtitle">Documentation written for AI agents, readable by humans.
              The Agent Kit tells each agent exactly what it can do, what files to touch, and what
              patterns to follow.</p>
            <div class="docs-hero-links"><a class="docs-hero-link"
                href="/docs/designer/instructions"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_ebd9e460d96049b195b5ef0b340cffc8~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_24,h_24/file.webp"
                  alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">Designer</a><a
                class="docs-hero-link" href="/docs/developer/instructions"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_838a1a4885714dae9579fe0b4d1a2293~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_24,h_24/file.webp"
                  alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="eager">Developer</a><a
                class="docs-hero-link" href="/docs/plugin/instructions"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_e235dbf4943c4208aba88b4ed6ddd402~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_24,h_24/file.webp"
                  alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="eager">Plugin</a><a class="docs-hero-link"
                href="/docs/devops/instructions"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_eaf3402bcc7c4fc784b5ae848a04af28~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_24,h_24/file.webp"
                  alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="eager">DevOps</a><a class="docs-hero-link"
                href="/docs/contracts/guide"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_28d5b6b49bd14042b0eae9070028acf6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_24,h_24/file.webp"
                  alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="eager">Contracts</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section docs-intro">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="docs-intro-content"><span class="section-label">Overview</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Why documentation for agents?</h2>
            <p>Traditional documentation explains concepts to humans. The Agent Kit takes a
              different approach — it provides <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">precise,
                specification-style instructions</strong> that AI agents can follow mechanically.
              Each role gets only the information relevant to its task, reducing hallucination and
              keeping agents within their boundaries.</p>
            <p>The Agent Kit is generated into the <code jay-design="allow"
                style="background: var(--color-surface-high); border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding: 0.15em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875em;">agent-kit/</code>folder
              in your project root by running <code jay-design="allow"
                style="background: var(--color-surface-high); border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding: 0.15em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875em;">jay-stack
                setup</code> followed by <code jay-design="allow"
                style="background: var(--color-surface-high); border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding: 0.15em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875em;">jay-stack
                agent-kit</code>. Setup initializes your project's services; agent-kit then executes
              plugin generators against those live services to produce contracts that reflect your
              project's actual configured state. The result isn't generic documentation — it's a
              machine-readable manifest of what your project can do right now.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section docs-kit">
        <div class="container"><span class="section-label">Generated Artifacts</span>
          <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">What's in the Kit</h2>
          <div class="docs-kit-grid">
            <div class="docs-kit-card glass-panel">
              <h3>Plugins Index</h3>
              <p><code>plugins-index.yaml</code></p>
              <p>The master discovery index. Lists every installed plugin's contracts, actions,
                services, contexts, routes, and CLI commands. This is how an agent finds out what's
                available — a single machine-readable manifest for the entire project.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-kit-card glass-panel">
              <h3>Materialized Contracts</h3>
              <p><code>materialized-contracts/</code></p>
              <p>Static contracts copied and dynamic contracts generated by executing plugin code
                against your project's live services. These aren't just docs — they're the actual
                tag schemas, data types, and props that agents bind to when writing templates and
                components.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-kit-card glass-panel">
              <h3>References</h3>
              <p><code>references/</code></p>
              <p>Plugin-generated reference data from your project's data sources — product
                catalogs, collection schemas, media indexes. Agents use these to produce realistic,
                grounded content instead of placeholder data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-kit-card glass-panel">
              <h3>Role Guides</h3>
              <p><code>designer/</code>
                <code>developer/</code><code>plugin/</code><code>devops/</code></p>
              <p>Each role gets its own directory with an <code>INSTRUCTIONS.md</code> entry point
                and topic-specific guides — template syntax, routing, component state, deployment,
                and more. Agents read only the guides relevant to their role.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section docs-workflow">
        <div class="container"><span class="section-label">Discovery</span>
          <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">How Agents Use It</h2>
          <div class="docs-workflow-steps">
            <div class="docs-workflow-step glass-panel">
              <div class="docs-workflow-number">1</div>
              <h3>Discover</h3>
              <p>Read <code>plugins-index.yaml</code> and the role's <code>INSTRUCTIONS.md</code> to
                learn what's available and how to work with it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-workflow-step glass-panel">
              <div class="docs-workflow-number">2</div>
              <h3>Understand</h3>
              <p>Read materialized contracts for exact tag schemas, data types, and prop
                definitions. Read references for real project data — product catalogs, collection
                schemas.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-workflow-step glass-panel">
              <div class="docs-workflow-number">3</div>
              <h3>Execute</h3>
              <p>Write code that follows the contracts. Run CLI commands like <code>jay-stack
                  action</code> for live data discovery and code generation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-workflow-step glass-panel">
              <div class="docs-workflow-number">4</div>
              <h3>Validate</h3>
              <p>Run <code>jay-stack validate</code> to check correctness. When validation fails,
                the agent-kit guides explain the fix — a feedback loop back to the contracts and
                patterns.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section docs-roles">
        <div class="container">
          <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;"><span class="section-label">Guides</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Browse by Role</h2>
            <p
              style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; max-width: 700px; margin-top: 16px;">
              These guides are published here for the curious human. AI agents read them directly
              from the <code jay-design="allow"
                style="background: var(--color-surface-high); border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding: 0.15em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85em;">agent-kit/</code>folder
              in your project root, generated locally by the CLI.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="docs-roles-grid"><a
              class="docs-role-card glass-panel docs-role-card--designer"
              href="/docs/designer/instructions"><img class="docs-role-icon"
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_ebd9e460d96049b195b5ef0b340cffc8~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_80,h_80/file.webp"
                alt="Designer" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
              <div class="docs-role-body">
                <h3>Designer</h3>
                <p>Creates <code>.jay-html</code> pages and templates. Binds to contract data using
                  template syntax — data bindings, conditions, loops, and refs. Styles pages with
                  CSS.</p><span class="docs-role-link">25 guides &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a><a class="docs-role-card glass-panel docs-role-card--developer"
              href="/docs/developer/instructions"><img class="docs-role-icon"
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_838a1a4885714dae9579fe0b4d1a2293~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_80,h_80/file.webp"
                alt="Developer" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
              <div class="docs-role-body">
                <h3>Developer</h3>
                <p>Creates page components, defines page contracts, configures routing, and sets up
                  project services. Builds the full-stack logic — unburdened from HTML or CSS.</p>
                <span class="docs-role-link">13 guides &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a><a class="docs-role-card glass-panel docs-role-card--plugin"
              href="/docs/plugin/instructions"><img class="docs-role-icon"
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_e235dbf4943c4208aba88b4ed6ddd402~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_80,h_80/file.webp"
                alt="Plugin Developer" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
              <div class="docs-role-body">
                <h3>Plugin Developer</h3>
                <p>Creates reusable headless components packaged as plugins. Defines contracts,
                  actions, services, and CLI commands that other projects consume.</p><span
                  class="docs-role-link">20 guides &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a><a class="docs-role-card glass-panel docs-role-card--devops"
              href="/docs/devops/instructions"><img class="docs-role-icon"
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_eaf3402bcc7c4fc784b5ae848a04af28~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_80,h_80/file.webp"
                alt="DevOps" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
              <div class="docs-role-body">
                <h3>DevOps</h3>
                <p>Handles production builds, deployment configuration, serving modes, and cache
                  invalidation. Manages the Two-Server Architecture.</p><span
                  class="docs-role-link">6 guides &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a><a class="docs-role-card glass-panel docs-role-card--contracts"
              href="/docs/contracts/guide"><img class="docs-role-icon"
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_28d5b6b49bd14042b0eae9070028acf6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_80,h_80/file.webp"
                alt="Contracts" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
              <div class="docs-role-body">
                <h3>Contracts</h3>
                <p>The central binding concept. Contracts are the source of truth that connects
                  plugin logic to designer templates — the agent-kit materializes them into a
                  discoverable form. Covers YAML syntax, page and component contracts, linked
                  contracts, and graduated examples.</p><span class="docs-role-link">5 guides
                  &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a></div>
          <div class="docs-extensibility">
            <p><strong>Extensible by plugins.</strong> The agent-kit isn't static framework docs —
              plugins can extend it with their own role-specific guides. When you install a plugin,
              its guides are automatically included in the kit alongside the framework's own
              documentation, growing the kit with your project.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main><jay:site-footer ref="siteFooter">
      <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="footer-grid">
            <div>
              <div class="footer-brand">Jay Framework</div>
              <p class="footer-copyright">Built with Jay Stack. The self-correcting visual ecosystem
                for AI-native web development.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="footer-heading">Resources</h2>
              <ul class="footer-links">
                <li><a href="/docs">Documentation</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="footer-heading">Legal</h2>
              <ul class="footer-links">
                <li><a href="#">Security Policy</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Privacy</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="footer-heading">Learn More</h2>
              <p class="footer-copyright">Jay bridges the gap between probabilistic AI outputs and
                deterministic engineering standards.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </jay:site-footer>
  </div>
</body>

</html>